      "type": "text",
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"certificate\": {\n    \"number\": \"R49/2013-A-CZ1-2022.02\",\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"page_total\": 16,\n    \"member_state\": \"Czech Republic\",\n    \"date_issued\": \"2022-05-30\"\n  },\n  \"issuing_authority\": {\n    \"name\": \"Czech Metrology Institute\",\n    \"address_lines\": [\"Okružní 31\", \"638 00 Brno\", \"Czech Republic\"],\n    \"person_responsible\": \"Jan Kalandra\"\n  },\n  \"applicants\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"ISOIL INDUSTRIA SPA\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"Via F.lli Gracchi, 27\", \"Cinisello Balsamo\", \"20 099 Italy\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"manufacturers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Hemina SPA\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"Via Piemonte 1, Montagnana – PD\", \"PC: 350 44\", \"Italy\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"certified_type\": {\n    \"category\": \"Water meter\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\"MS2500 / MV110\"],\n    \"module_designation\": null,\n    \"description\": \"The water meters type MS2500 / MV110 are electromagnetic water meters with an electronic indicating device, designed to measure, memorise and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer. They consist of a sensor and converter in compact set-up or separate version with connecting cable. The sensor MS2500 has a steel body with connecting flanges, one pair of excitation coils and electrodes, and can be equipped with PTFE, polypropylene, Rilsan or ebonite liners. The converter MV110 has a plastic and aluminium body with an LCD display showing volume and flow; volume resolution of 0.001 m³; three control buttons; communication via impulse output and current output, with non-legally-relevant communication possible by RS485 output or USB mini-B. Several security levels are provided by passwords. The meters are available in HV, LV and LLV power supply variants and can be installed to operate in any positions.\"\n  },\n  \"model_family\": {\n    \"family_name\": null,\n    \"models\": [\n      {\n        \"model_id\": \"MS2500/MV110 HV\",\n        \"label\": \"Power supply by mains 100–240 V AC\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"model_id\": \"MS2500/MV110 LV\",\n        \"label\": \"Power supply by mains 24–36 V AC/DC\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"model_id\": \"MS2500/MV110 LLV\",\n        \"label\": \"Power supply by mains 10–48 V DC\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"components\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"sensor (measurement transducer)\",\n      \"type_designations\": [\"MS2500\"],\n      \"characteristics\": {\n        \"liner_types\": [\"PTFE\", \"Polypropylene\", \"Rilsan\", \"Ebonite\"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"converter (electronic indicating device)\",\n      \"type_designations\": [\"MV110\"],\n      \"characteristics\": {\n        \"display\": \"LCD showing volume and flow\",\n        \"communication_interfaces\": [\"impulse output\", \"current output\", \"RS485\", \"USB mini-B\"]\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"characteristics\": {\n    \"type_level\": {\n      \"volume_resolution\": {\n        \"value\": 0.001,\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"m³\",\n        \"unit_id\": null\n      }\n    },\n    \"model_level\": [\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"power_supply_voltage\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"V\",\n        \"values\": [\n          { \"model\": \"MS2500/MV110 HV\", \"value\": { \"min\": 100, \"max\": 240 } },\n          { \"model\": \"MS2500/MV110 LV\", \"value\": { \"min\": 24, \"max\": 36 } },\n          { \"model\": \"MS2500/MV110 LLV\", \"value\": { \"min\": 10, \"max\": 48 } }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"power_supply_type\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": null,\n        \"values\": [\n          { \"model\": \"MS2500/MV110 HV\", \"value\": \"AC\" },\n          { \"model\": \"MS2500/MV110 LV\", \"value\": \"AC/DC\" },\n          { \"model\": \"MS2500/MV110 LLV\", \"value\": \"DC\" }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"config_level\": [\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"nominal_size_range\",\n        \"axis\": \"liner_type\",\n        \"values\": [\n          { \"condition\": \"PTFE\", \"value\": { \"min\": 25, \"max\": 350 }, \"unit_symbol\": \"DN\" },\n          { \"condition\": \"Polypropylene\", \"value\": { \"min\": 25, \"max\": 150 }, \"unit_symbol\": \"DN\" },\n          { \"condition\": \"Rilsan\", \"value\": { \"min\": 50, \"max\": 350 }, \"unit_symbol\": \"DN\" },\n          { \"condition\": \"Ebonite\", \"value\": { \"min\": 200, \"max\": 350 }, \"unit_symbol\": \"DN\" }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"maximum_water_temperature\",\n        \"axis\": \"liner_type\",\n        \"values\": [\n          { \"condition\": \"PTFE\", \"value\": 90, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\" },\n          { \"condition\": \"Polypropylene\", \"value\": 50, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\" },\n          { \"condition\": \"Rilsan\", \"value\": 50, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\" },\n          { \"condition\": \"Ebonite\", \"value\": 50, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\" }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"recommendation\": {\n    \"id\": \"R49\",\n    \"edition\": 2013,\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"accuracy_classes\": [\"1\", \"2\"]\n  },\n  \"test_reports\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0511-ER-V062-20\",\n      \"date\": \"2022-05-19\",\n      \"pages\": 254,\n      \"role\": \"type_evaluation_report\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6015-PT-P5001-22\",\n      \"pages\": 94,\n      \"role\": \"test_report\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6011-PT-SW009-22\",\n      \"pages\": 9,\n      \"role\": \"test_report\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8551-PT-E0041-21\",\n      \"pages\": 29,\n      \"role\": \"test_report\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0511-UL-V062-20\",\n      \"role\": \"documentation_file\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"revision_history\": [\n    {\n      \"revision\": \"0\",\n      \"date\": \"2022-05-30\",\n      \"changes\": \"Issuing certificate\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
    }
